00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:13.750
And today we're going to talk
a little bit about architecting

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:16.270
for performance when
you're building large scale

00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:19.120
applications in the cloud.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.280
Just a quick process
